/-! Exact endpoint quadratic factors and first-jet source forms.

The `z` factors clear the ratio denominator before any outer-coordinate
expansion. The four `jet` definitions are static reduced source forms;
their coordinate identities connect them to the proved SmallGap R factors.
Extraction as f^0/f^1 coefficients of the full core is not proved here.
-/
namespace SPR.N6.Tail.SmallGap.EndpointSource
noncomputable section
set_option Elab.async false
set_option maxRecDepth 32768
set_option maxHeartbeats 0

